Code differences of the Japanese Diamond and Pearl cartridges from US.

Japanese, the first release, was compiled with Metrowerks 1.2, which has no
__declspec(noreturn). Its start menu (asm/unk_02035068.s) is written out from
the cartridge in diamond-japanese-start-menu.s.

- NitroMain does not read the backlight or clear UNK_02016FA4.
- Closing the lid sleeps once; a Game Pak pulled out while asleep powers the
  system off, and opening the lid turns the backlight on rather than restoring it.
- SaveGame does not clobber the chunk footers of a new game.
- Three save functions differ only in how their source was written: the
  compiler allocates registers differently.

